"<strong>Cool a vapor</strong> shows condensation on the cold floor, with the temperature holding while bonds form.",
"<strong>Q1.</strong> Predict: {#} g of ice at −{#} °C sits on a {#} W hot plate. Sketch the temperature against time until it has all boiled away, and say which stage lasts longest.",
