"<strong>\"Heat and temperature are the same thing.\"</strong> On a plateau heat goes in and the temperature does not change.",
"<strong>\"Boiling water gets hotter if you turn the heat up.\"</strong> At a fixed pressure it boils faster at the same temperature.",
"<strong>\"Particles stop moving in a solid.\"</strong> They vibrate, and at the melting point they move as fast on average as in the liquid at that temperature.",
